Nova
Copyright 2026 EpsiRho

This product includes software developed by EpsiRho (https://github.com/EpsiRho/Nova).

Nova's descriptors follow the definitions published by Essentia (https://essentia.upf.edu) and
AcousticBrainz (https://acousticbrainz.org). No Essentia source code is included.

Tuned with the help of the AcousticBrainz dataset (CC0 1.0, MetaBrainz Foundation):
https://acousticbrainz.org/download
https://data.metabrainz.org/pub/musicbrainz/acousticbrainz/dumps/acousticbrainz-lowlevel-json-20220623

Tuned with the help of Google Magenta's E-GMD dataset (CC BY 4.0): https://magenta.tensorflow.org/datasets/e-gmd
Lee Callender, Curtis Hawthorne and Jesse Engel, "Improving Perceptual Quality of Drum Transcription with the
Expanded Groove MIDI Dataset" (2020), Google Magenta.